### OAuth2 Implicit

The implicit flow obtains the access token out of band (typically in the browser). Pass the token to the authenticator:

```ruby
authenticator = {{moduleName}}::Auth::OAuth::OAuth2ImplicitAuthenticator.new(
  'https://api.example.com', 'client-id', 'https://auth.example.com/authorize', ['read']
)
authenticator.access_token = 'your-access-token'
client = {{moduleName}}::{{clientClassName}}.new(authenticator)
```

{{/hasOAuth2Implicit}}
